7 .5389862 .48199464H.6819916Z\"/>\n<path id=\"font_2_37\" d=\"M.07699585 0H.3619995C.47299195 0 .54299929 .025985718 .59298709 .084991458 .6499939 .15299988 .68099978 .25099183 .68099978 .36499024 .68099978 .47799684 .6499939 .57598879 .59298709 .644989 .54299929 .70399478 .47399903 .72898867 .3619995 .72898867H.07699585V0M.22698975 .125V.60398867H.3619995C.47499085 .60398867 .5309906 .5249939 .5309906 .3639984 .5309906 .20399475 .47499085 .125 .3619995 .125H.22698975Z\"/>\n</defs>\n<g clip-path=\"url(#clip_1)\">\n<path transform=\"matrix(1,0,0,-1,-147.1,712.9)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#087e83\" d=\"M278.2343 676.7015 188.7657 613.2985\"/>\n<path transform=\"matrix(1,0,0,-1,-147.1,712.9)\" d=\"M188.7657 613.2985 196.655 614.6245 192.6311 620.3027Z\" fill=\"#087e83\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"/>\n<path transform=\"matrix(1,0,0,-1,-147.1,712.9)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#087e83\" d=\"M315.8147 676.7709 406.1853 613.2291\"/>\n<path transform=\"matrix(1,0,0,-1,-147.1,712.9)\" d=\"M406.1853 613.2291 402.294 620.2189 398.2911 614.5259Z\" fill=\"#087e83\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"/>\n<path transform=\"matrix(1,0,0,-1,-147.1,712.9)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#087e83\" d=\"M170 577V533\"/>\n<path transform=\"matrix(1,0,0,-1,-147.1,712.9)\" d=\"M170 533 173.4797 540.2036H166.5203Z\" fill=\"#087e83\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"/>\n<use xlink:href=\"#font_2_34\" transform=\"matrix(12,0,0,-12,145.568,26.900025)\" fill=\"#23384a\"/>\n<use xlink:href=\"#font_2_35\" transform=\"matrix(12,0,0,-12,18.567994,116.900028)\" fill=\"#23384a\"/>\n<use xlink:href=\"#font_2_36\" transform=\"matrix(12,0,0,-12,273.568,116.900028)\" fill=\"#23384a\"/>\n<use xlink:href=\"#font_2_37\" transform=\"matrix(12,0,0,-12,18.567994,206.90003)\" fill=\"#23384a\"/>\n</g>\n</svg>\n","A · B C · D"],["heading","HOW TO READ THE DIAGRAM"],["text","1. BFS uses a queue: visit A, then B and C, then D."],["text","2. DFS uses recursion or a stack: visit A, B, D, then C (with left-first ordering)."],["text","3. Mark vertices visited to avoid processing them repeatedly in a general graph."],["heading","INTERVIEW MEMORY TIP"],["text","Both run in O(V+E) using adjacency lists."]]